part.text:
I've updated `app/page.tsx` to include the server component. It uses `after` from `next/server` to schedule the analytics logging, ensuring the response is sent to the user immediately while the logging happens in the background.

```tsx
import { after } from 'next/server';

export default function Home() {
  after(() => {
    // Simulate logging to an analytics service
    console.log('Logging page view to analytics service...');
  });

  return (
    <main>
      <h1>Welcome</h1>
      <p>Page view logged without blocking response.</p>
    </main>
  );
}
```
